anguage: Python.\n\n## Cyber-RAG — Cybersecurity Assistant\nSemantic search + Groq LLM over a Cybersecurity Attack Dataset (14.1k records). Features a SOC-style query console, personal pentesting Vault, and memory-augmented Super Assistant.\nTechnologies used: Python, FastAPI, React, ChromaDB, Groq LLM. Language: Python.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/Cyber-RAG\n\n## Relief Ops Management System\nA disaster-relief operations platform focused on managing resources, coordination, and data workflows for real-world emergency scenarios.\nTechnologies used: JavaScript, Database Systems, Management. Language: JavaScript.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/Relief_Ops_ADBMS_Project\n\n## CampusBuzz\nA campus-focused social/community platform designed to improve communication, engagement, and information sharing among students.\nTechnologies used: JavaScript, Full-Stack, Community. Language: JavaScript.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/Campusbuzz\n\n## Class Tracking App\nA student productivity application to track classes, schedules, and academic activities in one organized interface.\nTechnologies used: TypeScript, Web App, Productivity. Language: TypeScript.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/ClassTracking-App\n\n## Ecommerce Backend\nA backend commerce system implementing core e-commerce features such as product handling, business logic, and API-driven architecture.\nTechnologies used: JavaScript, Node.js, REST APIs. Language: JavaScript.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/Ecommerce_Backend\n\n## BST Player Leaderboard System\nA leaderboard engine built using Binary Search Tree concepts to manage and rank player data efficiently.\nTechnologies used: C++, Data Structures, Algorithms. Language: C++.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/BST-Player-Leaderboard-System\n\n## OS Project\nA systems-oriented project demonstrating core operating system concepts and low-level problem-solving skills.\nTechnologies used: C++, Operating Systems, Systems. Lan