7873497,0.10327764600515366,0.07098443061113358,0.0749586671590805,-0.018845204263925552,0.0009779607644304633,0.04013914242386818]},{"source":"projects.md","chunkIndex":1,"text":"## Object Detection\nA computer vision project for detecting objects in images/video, highlighting practical AI/ML implementation skills.\nTechnologies used: Python, Computer Vision, AI/ML. Language: Python.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/Object-Detection\n\n## KeyLogger Project\nA low-level systems/security project exploring keyboard input capture mechanics using assembly language.\nTechnologies used: x86 Assembly, MASM, Security. Language: Assembly.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/KeyLoggerProj\n\n## Ping Pong Game\nA classic Ping Pong game implementation showcasing fundamentals of game loops, logic design, and interactive programming.\nTechnologies used: C/C++, Game Logic, Interactive. Language: C++.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/pingPongGame\n\n## Web Design\nA frontend-focused project emphasizing modern UI structure, styling, and responsive web design practices.\nTechnologies used: TypeScript, Frontend, Styling. Language: TypeScript.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/Web_Design\n\n## Retinal Blood Vessel Segmentation\nA digital image processing pipeline built to accurately detect and segment retinal blood vessels for medical diagnosis and analysis.\nTechnologies used: OpenCV, Image Processing, Python, Computer Vision. Language: Python.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/Digital-Image-processing-project\n\n## Stock Price Forecasting Dashboard\nAn end-to-end stock forecasting application featuring an interactive Streamlit dashboard, EDA views, and an LSTM model trained on historical ticker data to generate 7-day price forecasts.\nTechnologies used: Streamlit, TensorFlow, Pandas, Plotly, scikit-learn. Language: Python.\nGitHub: https://github.com/RaoUmair55/stock-forecasting","vector":[-0.07618599385023117,-0.037508103996515274,-0.03491438925266266,-0.040