ext":"# Rao Umair's Skills and Expertise\n\n## Cybersecurity\nDefensive security, threat detection & incident response.\nWazuh SIEM, honeypot deployment, custom detection rules, MITRE ATT&CK mapping, and incident management workflows for proactive defense.\nSkills include: Wazuh SIEM, Honeypot Deployment, Custom Detection Rules, MITRE ATT&CK, Incident Response, SOC Basics, OWASP, Nmap, Metasploit, Burp Suite.\n\n## AI / ML / DL\nBuilding models for classification, regression & pattern recognition.\nScikit-learn, TensorFlow, and PyTorch for supervised/unsupervised learning, model evaluation, and deep learning experimentation.\nSkills include: Scikit-learn, TensorFlow / PyTorch, Model Building, Classification & Regression, Deep Learning, Transformers, Sentiment Analysis.\n\n## Digital Image Processing\nMedical image analysis & computer vision pipelines.\nOpenCV-based pipelines for retinal vessel segmentation, morphological operations, edge detection, spatial/frequency domain filtering, and K-means clustering.\nSkills include: OpenCV, Morphological Operations, Edge Detection, Frequency Domain Filtering, K-Means Clustering.\n\n## Programming Languages\nPrimary tooling for cyber, AI, and systems work.\nPython (primary) for security automation and ML pipelines. C++ for systems programming and algorithms. MATLAB for signal/image processing research.\nLanguages: Python, C++, MATLAB, JavaScript, HTML, CSS.\n\n## Backend / Web Development\nBuilding APIs and full-stack applications.\nNode.js, Express, React for full-stack development. REST APIs, authentication, and database design when projects require a web interface.\nSkills include: Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL, REST APIs, MongoDB, SQL, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Vite.\n\n## Tools & DevOps\nSkills include: Git, Docker, GitHub, CI/CD, Linux.","vector":[-0.05251273512840271,-0.07857192307710648,-0.02307632751762867,-0.012648887932300568,0.05123728886246681,-0.06753356009721756,-0.01804722473025322,0.03089764714241028,-0